<h3 id="52-约束与门禁">5.2 约束与门禁</h3>
<p>约束分三级。L1是AGENTS.md文档约束，遵守率约70%。L2是CONSTRAINTS.md结构化约束，遵守率约85%。L3是CI脚本自动化检查，遵守率约99%。</p>
<p>迁移路径：L1到L2，当某个违规出现3次以上。L2到L3，当自动化条件成熟。</p>
<p>最低可行门禁清单（存放于 <code>.opencode/gates/pipeline.yaml</code>）：</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">gates:
  - name: compile
    command: ./ci/build.sh
    on_fail: block_merge
  - name: characterization_tests
    command: ./mvnw test -Dtest=CharacterizationTestSuite
    on_fail: block_merge
  - name: constraint_check
    command: python3 .opencode/constraints/check-merged.py
    on_fail: warn
</code></pre>
